&lt;div class=&#34;piece&#34; id=&#34;grandpa&#34;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Grandpa&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grandpa, Uncle Bruce, and Dad built the 16 Wellesley solarium in the early 80s. Its tall windows and wooden beams extended the house to the backyard garden. Later in life, with pride, Grandpa would ask me, &#34;Do you know who built that solarium?&#34; He asked me the same question every time we sat together in the solarium.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
